    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🇬🇧 🇫🇷 🇪🇸 🇧🇷 · Caresse vs InTheMoment · Audio in 4 languages"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Caresse vs InTheMoment:<br>listen before <em>committing.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "InTheMoment is an AI meditation and hypnosis app, on monthly plan. Caresse serves a different need — guided intimate audio — with a different approach: pre-generated audio demos you can play right now, in English, French and Spanish, no sign-up required. Anonymous mode requires no Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the app free</a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Free demos in the app, no sign-up. Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "disclaimer"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "disclaimer-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Honest note:</strong> InTheMoment is an AI-personalized meditation and hypnosis app. Caresse is an intimate audio app. If you're looking for one or the other, you already know which to pick. This page only compares <em>the AI approach</em> of both apps — because that's where we actually have something to say."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "tldr"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "In one sentence"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "The honest summary."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>InTheMoment</strong> showcases the modern AI promise: describe your situation, the AI picks from established meditation/hypnosis techniques and generates a custom session. Use case: personal wellness. <strong>Caresse</strong> applies the same AI philosophy to a much more delicate terrain — intimacy — but with one structural difference: the user doesn't drive the AI, the Caresse team has already written, tested and refined the prompts. You don't need to know how to talk to AI. You configure your intimate profile; the team has already done the rest of the work."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "verdict",
        "id": "verdict"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The verdict at a glance"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs InTheMoment — the AI angle."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict-table-wrap"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table"
              },
              "html": "\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Criterion</th>\n                        <th>Caresse</th>\n                        <th>InTheMoment</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Free audio demos, no account</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span> — demos playable right now</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Sign-up required to start</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Account required</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"no\">No Caresse account</span>; purchases use your Apple or Google account</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Account required</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Use case</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Guided intimate audio (couple and solo)</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">AI-personalized meditation and hypnosis</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">AI approach</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Team-curated prompts, multi-phase pipeline</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Open generation from user description</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Session driving</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Intimate-profile form (genders, names, practices, intensity…)</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Free-form conversation + voice/posture/technique selection</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Names spoken aloud</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Not documented</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Duration</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Varies with generation; exact length is not a setting</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Up to 20 min free, 45 min on Pro</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Pricing model</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Pay per session, no subscription</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Free plan + Pro $7.99/month</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Audio languages</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">French, English, Spanish and Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">English (free), 9 languages (Pro)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Content</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Intimate adult 18+</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Wellness / mindfulness</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group",
            "style": "margin-top:32px"
          },
          "blocks": [
