    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "pricing"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Pricing"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Per session vs monthly plan."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Two different models for two different use cases."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and demos. Personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>InTheMoment</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Free / Pro $7.99/mo</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">Free plan (2 sessions/day, 60-day storage). Pro plan (5 sessions/day, unlimited storage, offline, 9 languages). Price recorded 17 August 2026 on the US App Store listing.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "Pricing recorded 17 August 2026 from the US App Store listing and official site. Competitor pricing changes — verify before deciding."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "The right instinct: pick the app that matches your need, not your favorite AI app."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen to real audio demos before paying, no account required</li>\n                    <li>to use the app fully anonymously — no sign-up, ever</li>\n                    <li>an intimate audio experience (couple or solo)</li>\n                    <li>the voice to call you by name</li>\n                    <li>the guarantee that an expert wrote the prompt before you did</li>\n                    <li>to configure your intimate profile instead of chatting with AI</li>\n                    <li>to pay per session instead of a monthly subscription</li>\n                    <li>to listen to generated sessions in English, French, Spanish or Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose InTheMoment if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>an AI-personalized meditation or hypnosis app</li>\n                    <li>personal wellness content, not intimate</li>\n                    <li>to describe your situation freely to the AI</li>\n                    <li>up to 9 languages on the Pro plan</li>\n                    <li>a monthly subscription model</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Looking for a curated, pre-recorded catalog instead, in French or English? Compare with <a href=\"/en/vs-melba/\">Melba</a> or <a href=\"/en/vs-coelle/\">Coelle</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs InTheMoment — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I listen to Caresse before paying, without creating an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse offers pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish, playable immediately — no sign-up, no email, no account. Anonymous mode requires no Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account. That's a major difference from InTheMoment and almost every competitor that requires account creation."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Are Caresse and InTheMoment the same use case?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. InTheMoment is an AI-personalized meditation and hypnosis app. Caresse is a guided intimate audio app for couples and solo exploration. This page doesn't compare use cases — it compares the AI approach of the two apps, because that's where we're legitimately positioned to weigh in."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Why does Caresse talk about \"curated prompts\"?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Because AI generation without editorial direction produces content that's fine but generic. Every Caresse session runs through a multi-phase pipeline — setup, immersion, first touches, exploration, intensity crescendo, polishing — whose prompts are written, tested and refined by the Caresse team. Those prompts guarantee pacing, warmth of voice, narrative coherence. Same difference as text produced raw by AI vs text produced by an expert who knows how to drive the AI."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse personalize as much as InTheMoment?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse personalizes more on its intimate dimension: names spoken aloud, participants' genders, practices, accessories, intensity, dirty-talk level, setting, atmosphere. InTheMoment personalizes on its meditation/hypnosis dimension: voice, technique, posture, length, language (9 languages on Pro)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse work on a subscription like InTheMoment?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No, Caresse is pay-per-session. InTheMoment offers a free plan (2 sessions/day) and a Pro plan at $7.99/month (recorded 17 August 2026 on the US App Store listing). Caresse has no monthly subscription: you pay for the session when you want to live it."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse available in multiple languages like InTheMoment?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish. InTheMoment covers 9 languages on its Pro plan (German, French, Italian, Spanish, Arabic, Polish, Dutch, etc.) — broader, but for a different use case (meditation, not intimate)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
